OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club 'has just lost a
OL,4,Avery big part of its identity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans and club staff have been
OL,7,Fpaying tribute to Michael Wynn Jones,
OL,8,Fthe husband of TV cook Delia Smith,
OL,9,Fafter his death at the age of 85.
OL,11,FTogether with Smith, he was an honorary
OL,12,Flife president of Norwich City Football
OL,13,FClub, where they were majority
OL,14,Fshareholders for 26 years until 2024.
OL,16,FThe club held a minute's silence and
OL,17,Fopened a book of condolence in the Lion
OL,18,Fand Castle pub at the Carrow Road
OL,19,Fstadium, in which people were invited
OL,20,Fto leave their tributes.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
