OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club 'has just lost a
OL,4,Avery big part of its identity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff members could be seen in tears,
OL,7,Fwith one writing: "Norwich City has
OL,8,Fjust lost a very big part of its
OL,9,Fidentity. A true gentleman who will be
OL,10,Fsorely missed."
